{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>וַיְהִי בִּימֵי</b>, etc. The reason for the sequence of informing us of the matter is to say that these four kings were mighty. Go and learn the help of Elohim that was with Abraham, who wiped out the four kings at midnight along with the rest of the benefits."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:41:05.957212833Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}